---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description={`About ${SITE.title}, and who writes it.`}
>
  <article>
    <header class="essay-head">
      <h1 class="essay-title">About</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <p><em>{SITE.title}</em> is where I keep my essays.</p>

      <p>
        I write to find out what I think. The essays here are attempts, not
        conclusions.
      </p>

      <p>
        I publish here rather than on a platform because a link should still work
        in ten years, and because nothing on this page is trying to sell you
        anything. There is no schedule, no feed, no comments, and no reason to
        perform.
      </p>

      <p>
        My name is {SITE.author}. I build things for the web; that work lives at <a
          href={SITE.portfolio}
          rel="me">ilugbaroo.vercel.app</a
        >.
      </p>

      <p>
        The site is static HTML, built with Astro and published as files. The
        text is set in Source Serif 4, served from this domain rather than a font
        CDN. There is no analytics. The only thing this site stores in your
        browser is your choice of light or dark.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
